      "headline": "Rapha returns to WorldTour with Red Bull–BORA–hansgrohe",
      "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQMjhISXo4aExRZTZ1MTRwZF85aWlpZ2wzZ0k0LUFGM1h3UVNhMG00ZHYtMklELW9YSkdYaFFmYnB3Ulk0TWhoOTRGMFUxQWdYblVzdzVlNVEzbzBVWUduZjVMaGc4SHhQOG9ZeTZDV3FQUFpMbjRoSWdBdTF6Y3VJZTlXdGdiQ2R2WVQ2Tm1nN3RTd0tycXBrcmNxWXpfYjJtNUhYN1ZCbE9CUnVnWFdHQkhPMkItSnlIQjcw?oc=5",
      "source": "endurance.biz",
      "image_url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1794994791/cycling-bot/959aa59949-0.jpg",
      "image_urls": [
        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1794994791/cycling-bot/959aa59949-0.jpg"
      ],
      "full_caption": "Rapha is back in the WorldTour peloton.\n\nThe British clothing brand has been announced as apparel partner of Red Bull–BORA–hansgrohe, marking its return to the sport's top level. Details such as contract length and the start date were not part of the report we saw, so we will update once the team or brand confirms more.\n\nHow do you think Rapha's return will change the look of the bunch?\n\nSource: endurance.biz\n\n#Rapha #RedBullBORAhansgrohe #WorldTour #UCIWorldTour #ProCycling #RoadCycling #CyclingNews #CyclingKit #TeamNews #Cycling",
      "alt_text": "News graphic announcing that Rapha returns to the UCI WorldTour as apparel partner of Red Bull–BORA–hansgrohe.",
      "score": 8,
      "reel_url": null,
      "text_message_id": 55
    },
