      "headline": "Pogačar ends off-season: 'Now time to get serious'",
      "url": "https://www.cyclingnews.com/pro-cycling/teams-riders/now-time-to-get-serious-tadej-pogacar-wraps-up-off-season-of-travelling-running-and-fellow-pros-wedding-as-2027-preparations-set-to-begin/",
      "source": "Cyclingnews",
      "image_url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1794994802/cycling-bot/db1ea2c097-0.jpg",
      "image_urls": [
        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1794994802/cycling-bot/db1ea2c097-0.jpg",
