        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1794994803/cycling-bot/db1ea2c097-3.jpg"
      ],
      "full_caption": "Tadej Pogačar has called time on his off-season and is turning his attention to 2027.\n\nThe Slovenian ended his 2026 campaign early after crashing out of the Vuelta. He now heads to a UAE Team Emirates-XRG training camp in south-east Spain next month, and his full 2027 plan is due to be confirmed there in mid-December. The UAE Tour in February is expected to be his return to racing.\n\nWhich race will matter most to him in 2027?\n\nSource: Cyclingnews\n\n#Pogacar #TadejPogacar #UAETeamEmiratesXRG #UAETour #TourdeFrance #Vuelta #WorldChampionships #ProCycling #Cycling #WorldTour",
      "alt_text": "Graphic with the headline 'Pogačar ends off-season: Now time to get serious' for a cycling news post about Tadej Pogačar's 2027 preparations.",
